Job Title: Data Science Analyst


Job Description and Responsibilities:

    Develop program using Python, Oracle Procedure, Java and other tools for analytical data mining, software development, or business reporting.
    Responsible for project co-ordination related to the development and management of all project-related development, participate and manage in the design, specifications, coding, testing and implementation of bank’s application program and business reporting.
    Lead and facilitate sessions with business units to gather requirements, refine and document use cases, business rules, scenarios, and data, as well as functional systems requirements throughout the development lifecycle.
    Investigate and resolve application-related problems.
    Provide second-level support for the bank’s application system, including after-hour support as required.

Qualifications:

    Undergraduate degree in Computer Science and Data Science related fields;
    Be familiar with Python, SQL, BI report tools and Java;
    Good working knowledge of project management ;
    Excellent customer service skills;
    Able to communicate and writing skills in English and Mandarin or Cantonese;
    Ability to set priorities and work efficiently under pressure of high volume;
    Must be an independent problem solver with troubleshooting, decision making and analytical skills.


Education:

    Bachelor's Degree (preferred)

Licence/Certification:

    CISA, CISM, CRISC, CISSP (preferred)
